  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#the-canvas-element\n\n> let result be a Blob object representing a serialisation of the canvas element's bitmap as a file\n\nBut the API is defined as:\n\n```\ncallback FileCallback = void (File file);\nvoid toBlob(FileCallback? _callback, optional DOMString type, any... arguments);\n```\n\nSo is the result a `File` or just a `Blob`?  Gecko's implementation appears to be a real `File`.  If that's the intention, then the spec should probably say `File` instead of `Blob` here and mention what the `name` and `lastModified` attributes of the resulting `File` should be, right?\n",
